  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a80e7aaf-a864-4d1d-87b7-50ddf39fdc98.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">所有最好的僵尸末日模组在一个独特的模组包中！</span></strong></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>这个模组包不仅仅带来了最佳的所有现有与僵尸末日相关的模组在Minecraft……总共有超过100个模组让你的体验完整。</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>所有武器</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>+30种僵尸类型</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>3合1地图（3个最佳僵尸地图融合成一个地图）</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>血月</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>真实阴影（带末日雾）</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>僵尸陷阱&nbsp;</strong></span>&nbsp;</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>感染和医疗包系统</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>装饰方块</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>还有更多……</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">安装时小心，这个模组包极具传染性！只有当你有能力时才玩。</span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VwZl8ldIWvQ\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">新僵尸！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1131301/description_ce1952b6-8eca-4559-832c-6756d5bb922e.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">新项目！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1131301/description_d5ec0640-78ff-4bb0-b624-81742f80358b.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
